<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font size="4">You have been assigned a project proposal titled <strong style="">“</strong><b style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b><strong style="">”</strong> for review under the Wadhwani Innovation Network (WIN).</font></p><p style=""><font size="4"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="4"><strong>Review Deadline:</strong> Within <strong>10 days</strong> from the receipt of this email.</font></p><p style=""><font size="4">Please complete your review by logging in using the following link:<br><a href="https://wadhwanifoundation.my.site.com/reviewportal/s" target="_blank" class="cb-Settings-propertyValue js-settings-site-status-value" title="View published site in a new tab" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(1, 68, 134); text-decoration-line: none; transition: color 0.1s linear; cursor: pointer; outline: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;">https://wadhwanifoundation.my.site.com/reviewportal/s</a></font></p><p style=""><font size="4"><br></font></p><p style=""><font size="4">For any support or queries, feel free to reach out to us at <strong>win.admin@wadhwanifoundation.org</strong>.</font></p><p style=""><font size="4"><span data-teams="true"></span></font></p><p style=""><font size="4">Thank you for your valuable contribution to our mission of fostering innovation and impactful research.</font></p>

